":"riyadh_wv_mirage_restaurant","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["miragerestaurant","riyadh"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Taiwanese-Saudi run Chinese restaurant offering a variety of foods from throughout Asia, stick to the Saudized Taiwanese or Chinese menu items. The pigeon is a great appetizer as an alternative to the deep fried appetizer menu. The restaurant is accepting of business mixed gender groups. Ask for a table on top of the illuminated fish tanks in the center of the restaurant. Getting there can be diff","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Riyadh"},{"id":"riyadh_wv_the_globe","areaId":"riyadh","name":"The Globe","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":24.6896,"lng":46.68624},"visitMinutes":45,"photoSeed":"riyadh_wv_the_globe","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.alfaisaliahhotels.com/en/dining/the-globe-restaurant.html","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["theglobe","riyadh"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"Suspended 240 meters above Riyadh in the giant glass ball of the al-Faisaliah building, the Globe is the hippest cafe-restaurant and probably the single best splurge in town. So dimly lit at night that the waiters fade into the shadows, you can settle back in a plush leather seat, order a bottle of (non-alcoholic) bubbly, puff on a Cohiba and watch the lights of the city twinkle below. Reservation","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Riyadh"},{"id":"riyadh_wv_burj_al_hamaam","areaId":"riyadh","name":"Burj Al-Hamaam","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":24.66763,"lng":46.68202},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"riyadh_wv_burj_al_hamaam","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.burjalhamamksa.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["burjalhamaam","riyadh"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"One of the older Lebanese restaurants in town, this sparsely-decorated restaurant has had an enduring reputation. It is especially known for its \"Sayyadiyya\" and its \"Kibbe in pomegranate sauce.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Riyadh"},{"id":"riyadh_wv_al_shaya_persian_restaurant","areaId":"riyadh","name":"Al Shaya Persian Restaurant","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":24.71213,"lng":46.67504},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"riyadh_wv_al_shaya_persian_restaurant","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.shayah.net/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["alshayapersianrestaurant","riyadh"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"A chain of Iranian restaurants available at several locations in the city. They offer a good range of kebabs and a better range of mezze like tabbouleh, hummus, eggplant, vine leaves etc.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Riyadh"},{"id":"riyadh_wv_assaraya","areaId":"riyadh","name":"Assaraya","catego